 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Microsoft.ManagedIdentity api-version 2024-11-30 swagger. Every other official operation of this api-version returns HTTP 501 NotImplemented. Identities are metadata with generated principalId and clientId: no Entra service principal, token or credential is issued. Other catalog resources may assign them through identity.userAssignedIdentities; deleting an assigned identity is allowed, as in Azure. Federated identity credentials and system-assigned identity scopes are not implemented (HTTP 501).",
